6. Accordingly, the following order:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The claimant is entitle to total compensation of Rs.1,63,050/- along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till the date of realization, as against Rs.32,000/- awarded by the tribunal;
(iii) The respondent is directed to deposit the enhanced compensation of Rs.1,31,050/-
along with interest within a period of one month from the date of this order;
